    {
      "name": "Content Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Tonal grouping from the shared card primitive, with no resting shadow.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><header class=\"ds-card-header\"><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">Your playlists</h3><p class=\"ds-card-description\">Music you have collected.</p></header><div class=\"ds-card-content\">Playlist content</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{border-radius:12px;background:var(--secondary,#202226);color:var(--foreground,#f2f0ed);font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif)}.ds-card-header{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:24px}.ds-card-title{margin:0;font-size:24px;line-height:1;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-card-description{margin:0;color:var(--muted-foreground,#afb1b9);font-size:14px;line-height:20px}.ds-card-content{padding:0 24px 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation Item",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-item",
      "description": "Existing active-route treatment, with aria-current and tonal hover.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"/playlists\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8.25 6.75h12m-12 5.25h12m-12 5.25h12M3.75 6.75h.007v.008H3.75zm0 5.25h.007v.008H3.75zm0 5.25h.007v.008H3.75z\"/></svg>Playlists</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{padding:20px 16px;background:var(--color-gray-950,#0c0d0f)}.ds-nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--color-gray-300,#cecfd4);font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1),background-color 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-nav-icon{height:20px;width:20px;margin-right:12px}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=page],.ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--secondary,#202226);color:#fff}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,#b5a0eb);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-item{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dialog Surface",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "dialog",
      "description": "Static appearance preview; runtime focus management belongs to the shared Headless UI dialog.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-dialog-title\"><div class=\"ds-dialog-header\"><h2 class=\"ds-dialog-title\" id=\"ds-dialog-title\">Now playing</h2><button class=\"ds-dialog-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close now playing\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><p class=\"ds-dialog-copy\">Choose a song to get started</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-dialog{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;max-width:32rem;padding:20px;background:var(--secondary,#202226);color:var(--foreground,#f2f0ed);border:1px solid var(--color-gray-600,#4c4f58);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 20px 80px #0008;font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif)}.ds-dialog-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:20px}.ds-dialog-title{margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#fff}.ds-dialog-close{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:40px;min-height:40px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted-foreground,#afb1b9);cursor:pointer}.ds-dialog-close svg{width:20px;height:20px}.ds-dialog-close:hover{color:var(--foreground,#f2f0ed);background:#ffffff0c}.ds-dialog-close:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,#b5a0eb);outline-offset:3px}.ds-dialog-copy{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#afb1b9)}@media(min-width:640px){.ds-dialog{padding:24px}}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-dialog-close{min-width:44px;min-height:44px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Player Transport",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "player",
      "description": "Static transport preview with the observed neutral play button and labeled icon controls.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-player\" aria-label=\"Music player\"><div class=\"ds-transport\"><button class=\"ds-transport-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous song\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M21 16.811c0 .864-.933 1.406-1.683.977L12 13.607v3.204c0 .864-.933 1.406-1.683.977l-8.25-4.714a1.125 1.125 0 0 1 0-1.954l8.25-4.714c.75-.429 1.683.113 1.683.977v3.204l7.317-4.181c.75-.429 1.683.113 1.683.977v9.428Z\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-transport-play\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Play playback\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5.25 5.653c0-.856.917-1.398 1.667-.986l11.54 6.347c.777.427.777 1.545 0 1.972l-11.54 6.347c-.75.412-1.667-.13-1.667-.986V5.653Z\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-transport-icon\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next song\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M3 7.189c0-.864.933-1.406 1.683-.977L12 10.393V7.189c0-.864.933-1.406 1.683-.977l8.25 4.714c.756.432.756 1.522 0 1.954l-8.25 4.714c-.75.429-1.683-.113-1.683-.977v-3.204l-7.317 4.181C3.933 18.023 3 17.481 3 16.617V7.189Z\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-player{background:#191a1e;color:var(--foreground,#f2f0ed);border-top:1px solid var(--border,#36383e);padding:12px 20px max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}.ds-transport{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px}.ds-transport-icon,.ds-transport-play{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-transport-icon{min-width:40px;min-height:40px;padding:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted-foreground,#afb1b9)}.ds-transport-icon svg{width:20px;height:20px}.ds-transport-icon:hover{color:var(--foreground,#f2f0ed);background:#ffffff0c}.ds-transport-play{height:44px;width:44px;padding:0;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--foreground,#f2f0ed);color:var(--color-gray-950,#0c0d0f)}.ds-transport-play svg{width:24px;height:24px}.ds-transport-play:hover{background:#fff}.ds-transport-icon:focus-visible,.ds-transport-play:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,#b5a0eb);outline-offset:3px}.ds-transport-icon:disabled,.ds-transport-play:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-player{padding:8px 12px max(8px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-transport-icon{min-width:44px;min-height:44px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "overview": "This records the implemented refinement of the existing Spotibuds interface. Preserve the name and `public/logo.svg`. Charcoal surfaces recede behind music artwork and track information; muted lavender marks selected listening states and primary actions. Familiar labels and visible controls support browsing, listening, favorites, and playlists.\n\nThe system uses a system sans serif, compact task layouts, and tonal depth. This is an extraction from the current implementation, not a claim that every route has adopted every primitive or that live service workflows have been verified.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Artwork and song information lead the content hierarchy.",
      "One lavender accent sits within a dark neutral palette.",
      "Controls have readable labels, visible keyboard focus, and restrained motion.",
      "Persistent playback adapts to compact screens."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Single Accent Rule",
        "body": "Use lavender for action and selected state; keep artwork as the main source of varied color. Error and destructive states retain their functional red treatment.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the existing Spotibuds logo and music artwork.",
      "**Do** reuse the shared components and current CSS tokens.",
      "**Do** keep keyboard focus visible and label icon-only actions.",
      "**Do** retain the expanded player controls on compact screens.",
      "**Do** distinguish selected, loading, disabled, empty, and error states with text or semantics as well as color."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** introduce another decorative accent palette or ornamental gradients.",
      "**Don't** add shadows to every card or turn every row into a separate container.",
      "**Don't** hide essential actions exclusively behind hover.",
      "**Don't** remove reduced-motion handling, safe-area padding, or focus management.",
      "**Don't** treat screenshots or component snippets as proof of live backend behavior."
    ]
  }
}
